EI contact has soma-connected cable?</attribute><attribute class="java.lang.String" key="note">C02 | EI contact has soma-connected cable?

Status: NO

Method: Structural dissection / connected component

Scope / coordinates: Annotation 65017731: sender 3519995546, presynaptic component 55; receiver 3680152874 component 0.

Remaining search space: Both endpoints connect to the retained simulated somata through released cable, or at least one does not.

Binary predicate: Both endpoint placements are on soma-containing connected components with supported cable.

Decision limit: Exact component connectivity; no guessed joins or substituted soma emissions.

Recorded observation: The source is soma-free fragment 55. This anatomical contact is excluded from the simulation subset.

YES: Construct this supported projection.

NO: Keep the contact anatomical-only and simulation-blocked.

Next check: Resolve missing cable/placement evidence before enabling this edge; no morphology repair is part of this task.

Unresolved after either answer: Two other verified contacts are constructible; that does not repair this edge.

